The multi-account profile switcher under src/account/ and the test suite
under test/account/profiles.test.ts were lifted with light adaptation
from:

  rockuen/claude-account-switcher v0.1.1 (Apache License 2.0)
  https://github.com/rockuen/claude-account-switcher

which in turn forks the account-snapshot mechanism from:

  vishalguptax/claude-manager (Apache License 2.0)
  https://github.com/vishalguptax/claude-manager

The ported surface includes:
  - src/account/profiles.ts    (snapshot/swap/sync core, byte-for-byte)
  - src/account/parser.ts      (profile metadata parser)
  - src/account/mtimeCache.ts  (mtime+size keyed file cache)
  - src/account/switcher.ts    (QuickPick + save-current flows,
                                adapted from viewProvider.ts)
  - test/account/profiles.test.ts  (90 unit tests, byte-for-byte)

